<title>SPAIN: Spain industrial output reflects growth - Rato.</title>
<headline>Spain industrial output reflects growth - Rato.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Wednesday that the economy is in a phase of growth, a fact reflected in industrial production data.</p>
<p>Speaking at a Herald Tribune conference, Rato said &quot;Industrial production shows, along with other indicators, that the Spanish economy is within a phase of sustained growth for 1997 and following years.&quot;</p>
</text>
